: 1760552340:0;MAJOR MILESTONE: Database schema fully implemented and tested
: 1760552340:0;Schema Changes:
: 1760552340:0;- Created 12 tables (Users, Airlines, Airports, Aircraft, Seats, Flights, FlightSegments, Reservations, Passengers, Payments, Tickets, AuditLog)
: 1760552340:0;- Implemented segment-based flight architecture for connecting flights
: 1760552341:0;- Flights table now metadata container (no direct route/time/aircraft)
: 1760552341:0;- FlightSegments table stores each leg of journey (ISTâƒ¦ƒ²FRAâƒ¦ƒ²JFK support)
: 1760552341:0;- Direct flights = 1 segment, Connecting flights = 2+ segments (max 5)
: 1760552341:0;Technical Implementation:
: 1760552342:0;- 00_cleanup.sql: Safe database reset with proper dependency order
: 1760552342:0;- 01_create_tables.sql: All 12 tables with constraints and checks
: 1760552342:0;- 02_create_indexes.sql: 30+ performance indexes (including FlightSegments)
: 1760552342:0;- 03_create_constraints.sql: 18 foreign keys with cascade behaviors
: 1760552342:0;SQL Server Compatibility:
: 1760552343:0;- Fixed RESTRICT âƒ¦ƒ² NO ACTION (SQL Server syntax requirement)
: 1760552343:0;- Resolved cascade cycle issues with strategic NO ACTION placement
: 1760552343:0;- Proper ON DELETE/ON UPDATE behaviors without conflicts
: 1760552343:0;Database Architecture:
: 1760552343:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ Supports both direct and connecting flights
: 1760552344:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ Each segment can use different aircraft
: 1760552344:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ Independent status per segment
: 1760552344:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ Optimized indexes for route search
: 1760552344:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ 18 foreign key relationships enforced
: 1760552344:0;Testing:
: 1760552345:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ All scripts executed successfully in DBeaver
: 1760552345:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ No SQL Server errors
: 1760552345:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ All constraints work without cascade cycles
: 1760552345:0;âƒ¼ƒ¥ Database verified with npm run db:test
